        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<h2>The Model Context Protocol: A Game Changer</h2><p>The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is revolutionizing how we interact with content management systems. It provides a standardized way to access and manipulate content, making it easier than ever to build powerful applications on top of Umbraco.</p><h3>Why Developers Love It</h3><p>MCP abstracts away the complexity of the Umbraco API, giving developers a clean, consistent interface to work with. Whether you're building a headless CMS application or integrating content with external systems, MCP makes it intuitive and straightforward.</p><h3>Content at Scale</h3><p>With MCP, managing large amounts of content becomes effortless. The protocol is designed to handle batch operations efficiently, making it perfect for enterprise-level applications that need to process thousands of documents.</p><p>The future of content management is here, and it's powered by MCP.</p>",
            "blocks": {
              "layout": {},
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": []
            }
          }
        }
      ],
